Microsoft Playwright (https://github.com/microsoft/playwright) and
Playwright MCP (https://github.com/microsoft/playwright-mcp)
Apache License, Version 2.0, Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation

  - ds-bot/src/host/browser/ follows the browser tools of Playwright MCP:
    the ARIA page snapshot with [ref=eN] element refs, a fresh snapshot
    returned by every action, and the per-action tool set (open, snapshot,
    click, upload, type, select, press, tabs, back, screenshot). The
    session drives the browser through the Playwright API itself
    (ariaSnapshot({ mode: 'ai' }) and the aria-ref locators those refs
    resolve to). The playwright package is not bundled: the plugin loads
    it at run time from the install it is pointed at (playwrightUrl),
    the same way it uses the host's @deepseek-ai/* packages.

  The license is the same Apache License, Version 2.0 that covers this
  repository; see LICENSE for the text.

DSH Remote (https://github.com/liguobao/deepseek-harness-remote)
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 DSH Remote contributors

  The mobile app's link code in mobile/src/link/ adapts code from commit
  4d888ad of DSH Remote. DS Bot changed the names, the Noise prologue label
  and the fragment marker, so the protocol is DS Bot's own and does not talk
  to DSH Remote.
  - mobile/src/link/noise.ts adapts packages/crypto/src/noise.ts (the Noise
    IK session and the remote-key check).
  - mobile/src/link/keys.ts copies the key pair, fingerprint and Base64URL
    functions of packages/crypto/src/index.ts.
  - mobile/src/link/frames.ts adapts packages/protocol/src/index.ts: the
    control frame and message envelopes, the frame size limits, and
    SecureMessageCodec. It checks frames by hand instead of with zod.
  - mobile/src/link/transport.ts copies packages/webrtc/src/transport.ts and
    packages/webrtc/src/websocket-backpressure.ts.
  - mobile/src/link/relay-transport.ts adapts RelayTransport in
    packages/webrtc/src/index.ts.
  - mobile/src/link/secure-transport.ts adapts
    apps/android/src/services/secure-transport.ts.
  - mobile/src/link/rpc-client.ts adapts RemoteClientCore in
    packages/client-core/src/index.ts.
  - mobile/src/polyfills.ts copies apps/android/src/polyfills.ts.

  Full license text: the same MIT terms as printed under DeepSeek Harness
  above, with the copyright line of DSH Remote.

No other third-party code is copied into this repository. At run time the
plugin uses the @deepseek-ai/* packages of the DeepSeek Harness install it
runs in; they are not bundled. esbuild is a build tool only. The desktop app
in app/ installs the pinned @deepseek-ai/* packages, Electron and pnpm from
npm; they keep their own licenses. The build of its window (app/ui) bundles,
from npm, React and React DOM (MIT, Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and
affiliates), and react-markdown and remark-gfm with the packages they use
(MIT, most of them Copyright (c) Titus Wormer; @ungap/structured-clone is ISC,
Copyright (c) Andrea Giammarchi). Vite is a build tool only. The mobile app in
mobile/ bundles, from npm, Expo and React Native (MIT, Copyright (c) 650
Industries, Inc. and Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates), @noble/ciphers,
@noble/curves and @noble/hashes (MIT, Copyright (c) Paul Miller) and
@lukeburns/clatterjs (MIT, Copyright (c) 2025 Joni Lepistö).

==============================================================================
Projects that gave us ideas (no code copied)
==============================================================================

We thank these projects for the designs they published. DS Bot learned from
their ideas; it does not contain their code.

  - AgentMemoryRepo (https://github.com/AgentMemoryRepo/agentmemoryrepo), MIT:
    the Markdown format of Bot memory (one entry per line with [key: value]
    metadata, a MEMORY.md index that links topic files).
  - OpenAI Codex (https://github.com/openai/codex), Apache-2.0:
    keeping the user's messages next to the summary in a checkpoint, and
    message anchors for searching earlier chat.
  - OpenMausBot (https://github.com/milind-soni/OpenMausBot), Apache-2.0:
    group chat rounds and @mention relays between Bots.
  - Hermes Agent (https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent) and
    Hermes Bot Mode (https://github.com/NousResearch/Hermes-Bot-Mode), MIT:
    one Session per member per group chat, and the list of earlier user
    messages that the plugin, not the model, writes into the handoff.
  - OpenCode (https://github.com/sst/opencode), MIT;
    goose (https://github.com/block/goose), Apache-2.0;
    pi (https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono), MIT;
    Gemini CLI (https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli), Apache-2.0:
    when to condense a long conversation, and what a handoff note holds.
  - obelisk (https://github.com/tommy0103/obelisk), AGPL-3.0:
    searching a Bot's own chat with a SQLite FTS5 index ranked by BM25.
  - DeepSeek Harness Voice Input plugin
    (packages/experimental/client-ui-voice-input), MIT: the voice chat
    records with the same steps (record, resample to 16 kHz mono, PCM16 WAV)
    before it calls the plugin's speech service.
